                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "The UUID of the Bitbucket repository. Only used if using Bitbucket OIDC for permissions. Found at https://bitbucket.org/<WORKSPACE>/<REPOSITORY>/admin/addon/admin/pipelines/openid-connect"
